claim.claim-text:
- a substrate (110);
- a functional thermal signal layer (120), which is provided directly or indirectly on the substrate (110) and which comprises electrically conductive material arranged to form an array of independently controlled thermal elements (200), which thermal signal layer (120) comprises electrically non-conductive sections (124) between thermal elements (200), wherein each thermal element (200) is configured to output a thermal signal, which is observable in the infra-red spectrum, upon exposure to a control voltage, and
- a functional radar signal layer (150) which is provided directly or indirectly onto the substrate (110), which radar signal layer (150) is configured to output a radar response signal, which is observable in the radio frequency spectrum, upon exposure to an external radar stimulus or excitation.
